            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.11.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 11:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tatachu Elija tama, “Ekapolon Akuj Namerikanyer, asubi ayong jiik etich kon bon. Nakaneni echwangakis Ngisirael achamunet nakolong ichamakinosi ka iyong, aukosi ngikenoi kon, nabo aar ngikadwarak kon daang. Ayong bon edongit, nakaneni esakete akiar ayong!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Ekapolon Akuj ngesi tama, “Topud tolot towo alokidiama emoru alongaren kang.” Totiaak Ekapolon Akuj kitoru neni, tomeu ekuwam lotiapolon tapak ngimoru, kieala ngatabab, nakaneni amam Ekapolon Akuj alokuwam kangolo. Adaunet a ekuwam, torikirikok akwap, nakaneni amam Ekapolon Akuj anarikirikokin kangina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adaunet a arikirikokin a akwap, bu akim, nakaneni amam Ekapolon Akuj anakim kangina. Adaunet a akim, bu etoil loochi ingaingaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari Elija etoil ngolo, tarap ereet keng a eworu keng sodi tolot towo anakituk a aburibur. Kingit etoil ngesi tama, “Elija, nyo isubi iyong kane?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
