        {
          "text": " Tatachu Elija tama, “Ekapolon Akuj Namerikanyer, asubi ayong jiik etich kon bon. Nakaneni echwangakis Ngisirael achamunet nakolong ichamakinosi ka iyong. Aukosi ngikenoi kon, nabo aar ngikadwarak kon daang. Ayong bon edongit, esakete akiar ayong!”",
