            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Ekapolon Akuj ngesi tama, “Tonyou tobongo nariet na eyei diyete Damasko, sodi toloma lore kiwasak Asael akimiet toliwor ekapolon a Siria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwasak Yeu lokookeng a Nimchi akimiet toliwor ekapolon a Isirael. Tolem Elicha lokookeng a Chapat lo ebunit alo Abel-meola kiwasak akimiet kilunyokin nados kon toliwor ekadwaran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itwaan ni ebuchar ani a Asael nyeara, eari Yeu. Ani ni ebuchar ani a Yeu, eari Elicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.1+2KI.9.2+2KI.9.3+2KI.9.4+2KI.9.5+2KI.9.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kapol 9:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nakaneni aisikini ayong ngitunga ngabunge ngakan-kaarei alo Isirael eyarete, ngulu daang kamunosi ayong, lu eringa nyeriedikokina Baal, kori nyenuakina akuj keng nasubuna.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
